<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-ISRAELI OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ISRAELI OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second-round results on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the $328,000 Israel Open tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
<p>2-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Johan van Herck (Belgium) 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>8-Scott Draper (Australia) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela) 6-3</p>
<p>4-6 7-5</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 3-1</p>
<p>(retired)</p>
</text>
